cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use COMPASS, please cite it as below."
title: "COMPASS: Comparative Modeling of Parameter-Space Synergy and Sampling"
abstract: >-
  A falsification study asking whether higher-order parameter interactions in
  phenotype-constrained conductance-based neuron models are neuron-specific
  biological signatures or generic consequences of nonlinear model structure,
  parameter sampling, covariance and conditioning on selected outputs.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-05"
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - computational neuroscience
  - conductance-based models
  - O-information
  - higher-order interactions
  - parameter degeneracy
  - sensitivity analysis
